<section class="sec" id="why">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">Why now</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">Why SAP ABAP, and <span class="serif">why now.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">Every SAP customisation, report, interface and migration object is written in ABAP, and the S/4HANA wave has created a multi-year backlog of conversion and clean-core development work. ABAP developers are the engine room of that entire migration economy.</p>
<div class="why-stats">
<div class="ws reveal"><b>2027</b><span class="t">Conversion deadline drives demand</span><p>ECC-to-S/4HANA conversions need ABAP developers for every custom object.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>Clean</b><span class="t">Core: the new skillset</span><p>CDS, RAP and released APIs created a modern ABAP profile in short supply.</p></div>
<div class="ws reveal"><b>30yr</b><span class="t">Careers, still hiring</span><p>ABAP has outlived every obituary; the installed base guarantees decades of work.</p></div>
</div>
<h3 class="reveal" style="color:var(--navy);font-weight:800;font-size:1.2rem;margin-top:44px">Why it is a smart move for you</h3>
<div class="diff-grid" style="margin-top:22px">
<div class="diff reveal"><span class="ic-badge"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-cap"></use></svg></span><b>A protected developer niche</b><p>Enterprise platform skills face far less competition than generic web stacks.</p></div>
<div class="diff reveal"><span class="ic-badge"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-chart"></use></svg></span><b>Engineering graduates convert fast</b><p>Any programming logic transfers; the platform depth is what we add.</p></div>
<div class="diff reveal"><span class="ic-badge"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-globe"></use></svg></span><b>Functional-plus paths open</b><p>ABAP plus FICO or MM knowledge makes the rare, highly paid techno-functional profile.</p></div>
<div class="diff reveal"><span class="ic-badge"><svg class="ic"><use href="#i-shield"></use></svg></span><b>AI raises, not replaces</b><p>AI drafts boilerplate; developers who know the platform review, integrate and own it.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
